OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to find goats stolen from a
OL,4,Asmallholding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of four goats that were
OL,7,Fstolen from a smallholding have
OL,8,Fappealed for help in finding them.
OL,10,FThe animals were taken from land near
OL,11,FLittle Hundridge Lane, Great Missenden,
OL,12,FBuckinghamshire, between Saturday night
OL,13,Fand Sunday morning.
OL,15,FMel Petrovic, 54, who lives in Tring,
OL,16,FHertfordshire, said she has not been
OL,17,Fable to sleep since the theft of the
OL,18,Fgoats, who she described as her
OL,19,F"babies".
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
