OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to find goats stolen from a
OL,4,Asmallholding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police said it was
OL,7,Fappealing for any witnesses or anyone
OL,8,Fwith information to come forward in
OL,9,Fregard to the theft of the four goats.
